<title>USA: Time Warner unit names Herda senior VP.</title>
<headline>Time Warner unit names Herda senior VP.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Communications said on Monday it named Larissa Herda senior vice president for sales.</p>
<p>Time Warner Communications is a unit of Times Warner Entertainment, owned by Time Warner Cable and U S West Communications Group.</p>
<p>Time Warner Communications sells dedicated and business switched telephone services.</p>
